# Legacy port-list format; new installations use PROTECTED_PORTS in settings.conf.
# Ports to PROTECT. One port / range per line. '#' comments.
# List only SSH (or other private TCP) services -- never public HTTP(S).
# Enable local server SSH separately with PROTECT_SERVER_SSH=on in settings.
#
# Examples:
#   22001
#   20000-20100
#   22003:30:20  # optional global rate/minute and burst
